# Automatic PR review (opt-in) — see docs/pr-review.md
# Scans open PRs across the reviewer agent's GitHub App installation and
# instructs it to review any the bot hasn't reviewed yet. The "needs review?"
# check is pure GitHub REST (no AI tokens); the agent is only woken when a PR
# actually needs review.
#
# Scheduling: the host does NOT run a timer for this. Add a system cron
# entry that invokes `ncl pr-review run` on your chosen cadence, e.g.
#   * * * * * /path/to/ncl pr-review run >/dev/null
# Without that crontab entry, `PR_REVIEW_ENABLED=true` alone does nothing.
# PR_REVIEW_ENABLED=true
# PR_REVIEW_AGENT_GROUP_ID=<reviewer agent group id>   # must have a github_app_identity
# PR_REVIEW_COOLDOWN_MS=1800000                         # re-dispatch cooldown if no review lands (min 60000)
# PR_REVIEW_STATUS_MESSAGING_GROUP_ID=<messaging_group id>  # chat to ping with "review requested" / "review complete" status updates
